        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Flair Door Lever Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe elegantly detailed Flair Lever will add beauty and sophistication throughout your home. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset. Available a lot of finishes in either single dummy, passage, privacy, keyed entry, and storeroom lock functions. Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for 1-3/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install Schlage lever, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage Flair door levers are resistant to tarnishing, discoloration and corrosion.  Plus, the wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough--just like this lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Flair Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece lever for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the F-Series Schlage Flair Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the lever while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (Keyed Entry Only):</b> Use when entry by a key is needed. Always locked, entry from the outside requires a key. The inside lever is always unlocked. The outside lever is fixed.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy and Storeroom Lock Lever Functions are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Flair Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Lifetime Bright Brass (505) Finish is not available for single dummy and privacy sets.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Flair Door Lever Set, Schlage F-FLA",
                "description": "Schlage F-Series Flair Lever Sets F-FLA - The elegantly detailed Flair Lever will add beauty and sophistication throughout your home. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset. Available 9 finishes in either single dummy, passage, privacy, keyed entry, and storeroom lock functions. Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for 1-3/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch thick doors.",
